  "raw_meta_yaml": "schema_version: 1\n\ncontext:\n  name: parcels\n  version: \"4.0.0\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ${{ name|lower }}\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/Parcels-code/${{ name }}/archive/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: c6214c39202aeb0ee0858529a3a778403cb07e8190fc3e862624ec36f1d3feea\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  noarch: python\n  script:\n    - ${{ PYTHON }} -m pip install . -vv --no-deps --no-build-isolation\n\nrequirements:\n  host:\n    - python ${{ python_min }}.*\n    - pip\n    - setuptools\n    - setuptools_scm\n    - setuptools_scm_git_archive\n    - wheel\n  run:\n    - python >=${{ python_min }}\n    - cf_xarray >=0.10.0\n    - cftime >=1.6.3\n    - dask >=2025.7.0\n    - holoviews >=1.22.0 # https://github.com/prefix-dev/rattler-build/issues/2326\n    - netcdf4 >=1.6.0\n    - numpy >=2.2.0\n    - pandas >=2.3\n    - polars >=1.32.0\n    - pooch >=1.8.0\n    - pyarrow >=21.0.0\n    - pyogrio # needed for geopandas (uxarray -> geoviews -> geopandas -> pyogrio, but for some reason conda doesn't pick it up automatically)\n    - tabulate >=0.9.0\n    - tqdm >=4.67.0\n    - uxarray >=2026.04.1\n    - xarray >=2025.8.0\n    - zarr >=3.1\n\ntests:\n  - python:\n      python_version:\n        - ${{ python_min }}.*\n        - \"*\"\n      imports:\n        - parcels\n      pip_check: false # Remove line to enable `pip check`. Do when next minor (vx.this.x) of uxarray comes out (currently its resolving to `v2026.08.0` which has broken metadata https://github.com/UXARRAY/uxarray/issues/1542#issuecomment-5390203863 )\n\nabout:\n  license: MIT\n  license_file: LICENSE.md\n  summary: Parcels - A highly customisable Lagrangian simulation framework\n  description: |\n    Parcels provides a set of Python classes and methods to create customisable particle tracking simulations using gridded output from geoscientific circulation models.\n  homepage: https://github.com/Parcels-code/parcels\n  repository: https://github.com/Parcels-code/parcels\n  documentation: https://parcels-code.org/\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - VeckoTheGecko\n    - erikvansebille\n    - willirath\n",
